<h4 class="boldbyline">
Re: The Whirlwind
</h4>

<p>
The subject of the story also posted to claim a series of inaccuracies in the reporting.  What's the reality? If he is right that the reporter misled him and then inaccurately reported such things as his actual speed, his violations record, etc.,  then there is a more serious problem than a bunch of readers blasting away bored in their cubicles. <br />
And that is our credibility. <br />

</p>
