<p>
David,  Thanks.  The opportunity for sources to respond to stories in an unmoderated post is fairly new territory. <br />
<br />
When they are unreliable it's like the lie that makes its way halfway around the world before the truth can get its boots on.<br />
<br />
My fear is once we lose credibility (even if undeservedly) it's hard to get it back. I will always be known to a certain percentage of people around here  as the Evil Columnist who put Grandpa John's Pumpkin Patch  out of business -- even though it's not true dammit.<br />
