<p>
I propose the following editor's note on all potentially controversial feature-like stories:<br />
<br />
"This Newspaper does not necessarily endorse the activities or the people performing said activities described in the following story. The story features an intriguing character who does things many of our wonderful and God-loving readers will find immoral. We know this. We are shedding light on this character and this activity so that you, the super-smart readers of this publication, who deserve only the best, will know more about what is happening in this wonderful and diverse community. Once again, this does NOT mean we would perform this activity ourselves, or let our well-behaved children do so, or that we would ever think about inviting the character described herein to our homes for dinner or any such thing (we wouldn't even let him dog sit, to be truthful). We just thought you'd want to know. We apologize in advance to anyone offended by reality. -- the editors"
